## UI Design OS (`.ai.ui/`)

**Coexistence:** [`.ai.ui/COHABITATION.md`](.ai.ui/COHABITATION.md) — UI skills write to `.work.ui/` only; do not overwrite `.work/plans/NEXT.md` except cross-links.

**Lost on UI?** [`.ai.ui/START_HERE.md`](.ai.ui/START_HERE.md) · **Router:** `@ui-process-router - <question>`

### Change safety (add to existing change-safety section or create one)

| Gate | Command | Fail when |
|------|---------|-----------|
| Touch scope | `bash .ai.ui/scripts/touch-scope-verify.sh` | File outside `.work.ui/touch-scope` |
| Blast radius | `bash .ai.ui/scripts/blast-radius-check.sh` | Cross-area diff ≥3 areas |
| Tests | `bash .ai.ui/scripts/framework-verify.sh` | Non-zero exit |
| Gate check | `bash .ai.ui/scripts/gate-verify.sh` | Done task with empty Notes |

### Data loss & destructive operations (union with Agent OS rules)

**Permission rule:** Explicit human approval applies **only to the current request (same message)** — never standing or permanent.

Unless requested in the **same message**, MUST NOT: `git commit` / `git push` / force-push / hard reset / `git clean -fd`; `DROP` / `TRUNCATE` / wipe any database or datastore; delete files or directories; overwrite `.ai/`, `.work/`, or replace `.cursorrules` wholesale (merge or `confirm-overwrite-cursorrules` only when named); modify **UI protected files** below without same-message permission.

### UI completion gate (addition to Core Principle 7)

UI milestone work is not done until: UI lint/type/tests pass; `@ui-visual-verify` + `@ui-accessibility-audit` pass or are waived in `{HANDOFF_UI}`; agent-assisted UI has `@ui-concept-run - UIS-06` unless **`human-only`** in the same message.

